# CHANGELOG.md

Every user-visible or contract change updates [`CHANGELOG.md`](CHANGELOG.md) in the **same** change set (Keep a Changelog, newest first).

Format:

- Top heading `## [Unreleased]` for work not tagged; on a protocol/release bump, add `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD` and move bullets
- Groups: `Added`, `Changed`, `Fixed`, `Security`, `Removed` (omit empty)
- One line per item: **why/effect**, not a file list
- Protocol bumps (`0.2.0`) get their own dated section
- Internal-only refactors with no operator/agent impact: skip, or a single `Changed` line if behavior shifted

Do not paste diffs, HMAC internals, or compose passwords.

Example: `Added experimental source types mssql/sqlite/clickhouse/dynamodb/cassandra/ksql (no harness).`
